{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06JN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathit{Aut}(x_0) \\to \\mathit{Aut}(\\varphi(x_0))$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-k-linear-differential}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c81501638d98511e841cced12ae5ebb590451ddcd771929337002e318920ba6b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b6fc0c09e558803550aea64237a635888c22997b4955580221d61a4bc00c851a", "source_text": "It is clear that <MATH_0001> induces a morphism from\n<MATH_0002>\nwhich maps the identity to the identity. Hence this follows from\nthe result for tangent spaces, see\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:86bbe25883506b27876df149cddf1e484d7893977a00e4154532525315ab8e6a", "unit_id": "tag:07W6:proof"}
